## Block PhoneInput
## source: registry/phone-input.json
## type: registry:ui
## layout: stack
## compose: Popover, Command
## icons: HTMLInputElement, PopoverTrigger, ChevronDown, PopoverContent, CommandInput, CommandList, CommandEmpty, CommandItem
